  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Choosing the adapter",
      "items": [
        "With DM_DDM_URL configured, the MDM role forwards declarative requests to the DDM role. Otherwise it calls the in-process adapter.",
        "The device continues to use /mdm; the internal forwarding endpoint is not a device enrollment URL.",
        "Both roles share one persistent database and compatible storage keyrings. Enrollment, inventory, declarations and replay state use that database; the hop does not copy inventory."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "authentication",
      "title": "HTTPS and directional signatures",
      "items": [
        "The adapters require HTTPS and independent request and response HMAC keys. Only explicit test configuration permits literal-loopback HTTP. Mutual TLS is an additional library option.",
        "Request signatures bind method, target, content type, timestamp, nonce and body. Response signatures bind that request envelope plus response status, content type and body."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "storage",
      "title": "Shared replay protection",
      "items": [
        "The receiving adapter checks five-minute freshness and atomically claims each nonce for ten minutes. All receiving replicas must share replay state; the reference server supplies its SQL protocol store.",
        "A failed signature, stale request or repeated nonce is rejected before the engine runs. HMAC authenticates the exchange; HTTPS provides transport encryption."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "failure",
      "title": "Error mapping",
      "items": [
        "Successful bodies and declaration-not-found responses pass back through the adapter. Bad requests map to service errors; other upstream failures become internal errors."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Declarative Management check-in \u2014 https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/declarative-management",
        "RFC 9440 \u2014 Client-Cert HTTP Header Field \u2014 https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9440",
        "Private DDM adapter contract \u2014 https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/80599ddc35778bcc88fa2ac77bb1dc68a51cf089/server/ddmadapter/internal/proxywire/doc.go"
      ]
    }
  ]
